OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 5 DEC
OL,4,G1300FChris Hawkins
OL,5,     GChris spins some joyous tunes to
OL,6,     Gget your Friday started and warms
OL,7,     Gup the dancefloor by opening the
OL,8,     GTrunk Of Funk!
OL,9,G1600FHuw Stephens
OL,10,     GIt's Friday so Huw is out to
OL,11,     Gprove that any song sounds better
OL,12,     Gwhen it's played on 6 Music by
OL,13,     GHuw Stephens - so let us know
OL,14,     Gwhat you want to hear.
OL,15,G1900FThe People's Party with
OL,16,     FAFRODEUTSCHE
OL,17,     GAn energetic celebration for the
OL,18,     Gend of the working week - a place
OL,19,     Gwhere people come together and
OL,20,     Glet loose, through their shared
OL,21,     Glove of music.
